.freebuff
.agent
.agents
.claude
.codex
.kilo
.vercel
.snowflake
.v0-trash
.neon
migration-inputs
brag-output
quality-evidence
refinement-evidence
seo-evidence
*legacy-export*.json
*firebase-export*.json

# Docs are not needed at runtime
DOCKER.md
